{"id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:local-nondegenerate-family","title":"def:local-nondegenerate-family","path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.md","line":2787,"body":"","kind":"definition","status":"not_started","tex":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex#def:local-nondegenerate-family","uses":["[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-field-scalar-products]]","[[references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product]]"],"inspired_by":[],"bindings":[],"is_index":false,"body_html":"","formal":[],"tex_content":{"path":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","label":"def:local-nondegenerate-family","line":4752,"source":"\\begin{definition}[Pointwise Nondegenerate Smooth Family]\n\\label{def:local-nondegenerate-family}\n\n\\uses{def:smooth-field-scalar-products, lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product}\n\n\n\n\nLet $g$ be a smooth field of scalar products on $V\\to B$. A family of sections\n$(X_1,\\ldots,X_m)$ is \\emph{nondegenerate on $u\\subseteq B$} if\n\\begin{enumerate}[label=(\\alph*)]\n\\item every $X_i$ is smooth on $u$;\n\\item $(X_1|_x,\\ldots,X_m|_x)$ is a nondegenerate tuple in $(V_x,g_x)$ for\nevery $x\\in u$.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{definition}","html":" <p></p><section class=\"theorem\"><div class=\"theorem-label\">Definition</div></section>[Pointwise Nondegenerate Smooth Family] <span class=\"tex-label\" id=\"tex-label-6465663a6c6f63616c2d6e6f6e646567656e65726174652d66616d696c79\"></span> <p></p><a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23def%3Asmooth-field-scalar-products\">↗ def:smooth-field-scalar-products</a> <a class=\"wikilink tex-use\" href=\"#node=references%2FLeeRiemannian%2Fblueprint%2Fsrc%2Fchapters%2Fchapter2%23lem%3Apseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product\">↗ lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product</a> <p></p>Let <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$g$\">$g$</span> be a smooth field of scalar products on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$V\\to B$\">$V\\to B$</span>. A family of sections <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(X_1,\\ldots ,X_m)$\">$(X_1,\\ldots ,X_m)$</span> is <em>nondegenerate on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u\\subseteq B$\">$u\\subseteq B$</span></em> if <ol><li><p>every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$X_i$\">$X_i$</span> is smooth on <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$u$\">$u$</span>; </p></li><li><p><span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(X_1|_x,\\ldots ,X_m|_x)$\">$(X_1|_x,\\ldots ,X_m|_x)$</span> is a nondegenerate tuple in <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$(V_x,g_x)$\">$(V_x,g_x)$</span> for every <span class=\"math\" data-display=\"false\" data-tex=\"$x\\in u$\">$x\\in u$</span>. </p></li></ol> ","warnings":[]},"previous":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:inv-sqrt-abs-smooth","next":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame","relations":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:smooth-field-scalar-products","title":"def:smooth-field-scalar-products","label":"def:smooth-field-scalar-products"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product","title":"lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product","label":"lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product"}],"backlinks":[{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","title":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators","label":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-denominators"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-orthonormal","title":"prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-orthonormal","label":"prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-orthonormal"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-flag","title":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-flag","label":"lem:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-flag"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-aux-smooth","title":"prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-aux-smooth","label":"prop:pseudo-gram-schmidt-frame-aux-smooth"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple","title":"lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple","label":"lem:open-nondegenerate-tuple"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family","title":"prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family","label":"prop:orthonormalize-nondegenerate-family"},{"kind":"uses","id":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","title":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family","label":"lem:extend-nondegenerate-family"}],"copy_context":{"version":1,"level":0,"node":"references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2#def:local-nondegenerate-family","title":"def:local-nondegenerate-family","tex":"\\begin{definition}[Pointwise Nondegenerate Smooth Family]\n\\label{def:local-nondegenerate-family}\n\n\\uses{def:smooth-field-scalar-products, lem:pseudo-metric-fibre-scalar-product}\n\n\n\n\nLet $g$ be a smooth field of scalar products on $V\\to B$. A family of sections\n$(X_1,\\ldots,X_m)$ is \\emph{nondegenerate on $u\\subseteq B$} if\n\\begin{enumerate}[label=(\\alph*)]\n\\item every $X_i$ is smooth on $u$;\n\\item $(X_1|_x,\\ldots,X_m|_x)$ is a nondegenerate tuple in $(V_x,g_x)$ for\nevery $x\\in u$.\n\\end{enumerate}\n\\end{definition}","source":"tex/references/LeeRiemannian/blueprint/src/chapters/chapter2.tex","description":"","dependencies":[{"node":"references/LeeRiemannia